Animation Philosophy

Animations must remain:

soft,
subtle,
premium,
lightweight.

Recommended:

fade transitions,
soft hover elevation,
smooth loading skeletons,
progressive appearance.

Avoid:

flashy animations,
fintech glow effects,
heavy motion,
excessive parallax.
Responsive Rules
Mobile

Workflow navigation:

horizontal scroll,
or
compact step pills.

Cards:

stacked vertically.

Hero:

simplified spacing.

CTA:

always visible without feeling sticky/aggressive.
Tablet

Maintain:

strong spacing,
simplified grid,
lightweight hierarchy.
Desktop

Use:

generous whitespace,
centered layout,
visual breathing room.

Avoid:

ultra-wide stretched dashboards.
Technical Constraints

IMPORTANT:

Preserve:

existing stores,
hooks,
routing,
API calls,
business logic,
workflow logic,
validation logic,
fiscal calculation systems.

Rebuild ONLY:

UI architecture,
visual hierarchy,
component composition,
spacing,
interaction design,
responsive system.

Do NOT:

rewrite business logic,
redesign workflow logic,
change data structures,
rebuild APIs.
Cursor Build Instruction

Build this dashboard from scratch using the lmnp-v2 architecture while preserving all existing business logic, stores, hooks, workflow systems, validations, and API integrations.

Focus exclusively on:

premium UX,
calm visual hierarchy,
lightweight workflow guidance,
responsive composition,
reusable V2 component architecture.